  "proved_invariant": "At accepted non-Ended (validated Active) samples, accepted owner inventory potions_healing > 0 iff the trusted serialized owner healing_until > the accepted frame source_time; accepted count equals the trusted HOT-row count; non-Empty HOT rows have last.next > source_time and healing_until == last.next + (left-1)*DEFINITION.step_ms; empty rows have count and deadline zero. Ended frames are excluded explicitly; missing inventory stays unavailable.",
